# Vite Plugin

Use Chemical in your Vite development and preview servers.

Add `ChemicalVitePlugin` to `vite.config.js` or `vite.config.ts`:

```js
import { defineConfig } from "vite";
import { ChemicalVitePlugin } from "chemicaljs";

export default defineConfig({
  plugins: [ChemicalVitePlugin()],
});
```

The plugin attaches Scramjet assets, `/sw.js`, and Wisp WebSocket upgrades to both `vite dev` and `vite preview`, and automatically configures `optimizeDeps` for Scramjet packages.
